n, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1f\udc23\ud802𐠞\udc03𐠰\ud802𐠣\udc28\udc02\ud802\ud802𐠢\ud802𐠑\udc2e𐠦\ud802𐠨\udc14\udc04\udc05\udc0e𐠈\ud802𐠟\udc29𐠛\udc29\udc0b\udc0e\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠊\udc2e𐠪\udc08\udc29𐠏\udc10\udc1a\udc1a\udc22\udc16\ud802\ud802𐠑\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":870.97,"y":8.2,"cell":68,"i":64,"name":"Ruined Fortress","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":222,"y":301.94,"cell":2446,"i":65,"name":"Ruined Pyramid","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":520.85,"y":453.64,"cell":4247,"i":66,"name":"Ruined Town","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1652.71,"y":691.63,"cell":6868,"i":67,"name":"Ruined Fortress","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":1315.26,"y":305.44,"cell":2649,"i":68,"name":"Cochamber Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":330.5,"y":476.1,"cell":4514,"i":69,"name":"Travelling Magical Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":527.22,"y":201.26,"cell":1576,"i":70,"name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1099.32,"y":385.32,"cell":3483,"i":71,"name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":1117.19,"y":505.91,"cell":4905,"i":72,"name":"Wistowces Melee","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of the greats in Wistowces, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":102.68,"y":400.14,"cell":3560,"i":73,"name":"Stotham Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Stotham, offering local wood, vinegar, and cheese alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":331.39,"y":289.36,"cell":2342,"i":74,"name":"Camels migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of camels are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1687.75,"y":564.72,"cell":5664,"i":75,"name":"Goats migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of goats are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":1314.77,"y":802.03,"cell":7703,"i":76,"name":"Diaphanous mirage","tags":[],"note":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1519.21,"y":855.19,"cell":8008,"i":77,"name":"Axbleham Sinkhole","tags":[],"note":"The Axbleham Sinkhole. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1490.84,"y":758.03,"cell":7342,"i":78,"name":"Towleighes Pit","tags":[],"note":"The Towleighes Pit. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1426.82,"y":634.73,"cell":6407,"i":79,"name":"Wihultony Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":167.79,"y":71.18,"cell":460,"i":80,"name":"Blechbury Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":654.67,"y":115.61,"cell":923,"i":81,"name":"Louthingra Graveyard","tags":[],"note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":510.4,"y":308.63,"cell":2582,"i":82,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2582\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":630.03,"y":69.11,"cell":496,"i":83,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/496\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":33.83,"y":252.55,"cell":1982,"i":84,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1982\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":945.9,"y":433.9,"cell":3980,"i":85,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3980\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1288.02,"y":188.75,"cell":1520,"i":86,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=